1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 22=

5
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,280
Need something, Mr. Xie?

6
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,799
You're moving out tomorrow, Mrs. Xie.

7
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,320
I'll be sleeping alone from now on.

8
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:40,440
♪I see summer in your smile♪

9
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,800
♪We talk until after midnight♪

10
00:00:45,626 --> 00:00:48,690
♪Just to stay a little while♪

11
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,600
♪Your hand is close, but never touches♪

12
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,880
How could I let you off tonight?

13
00:00:53,880 --> 00:00:54,880
♪You are asking for the nature♪

14
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,159
Don't do that.

15
00:00:58,186 --> 00:01:00,220
♪How do I love♪

16
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:04,000
♪If your heart is feeling my way?♪

17
00:01:05,026 --> 00:01:08,106
♪How do I breathe♪

18
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:12,226
♪When you look at me that way?♪

19
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:15,293
♪When you say my name♪

20
00:01:15,293 --> 00:01:16,693
♪Say my name♪

21
00:01:36,799 --> 00:01:37,519
(Mr. Xie:)
(I've had)

22
00:01:37,799 --> 00:01:39,640
(your things all moved
to your new home.)

23
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:41,359
(Head there when you wake up.)

24
00:01:41,959 --> 00:01:42,840
(No need for extra trips.)

25
00:01:43,719 --> 00:01:44,680
(I'm off to work.)

26
00:01:51,079 --> 00:01:52,879
(I'm the one who insisted on moving.)

27
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:55,560
(But now that I'm really leaving,)

28
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,920
(why is it so hard to go?)

29
00:02:01,120 --> 00:02:04,880
(One Week Later)

30
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:10,740
(Bao'er Calling)

31
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:15,800
Hello.

32
00:02:16,039 --> 00:02:16,919
What's wrong, Bao'er?

33
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:19,879
Hua...

34
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:23,400
I'm in big trouble.

35
00:02:24,599 --> 00:02:25,879
Fought with your dad again?

36
00:02:27,039 --> 00:02:27,599
No.

37
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,919
He makes me come home at seven

38
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:31,520
every night to study.

39
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:34,000
He even hired me a private tutor.

40
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,719
You're already in college.

41
00:02:35,879 --> 00:02:36,639
Studying for what?

42
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:38,360
Exactly!

43
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,400
He wants me to take the TOEFL.

44
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,919
Three months of study boot camp!

45
00:02:44,759 --> 00:02:46,199
(Bao'er hates studying.)

46
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,879
(She'll be lucky just to graduate.)

47
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,360
(And now the TOEFL?)

48
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,240
(Is he sending her to study in the US?)

49
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:52,120
Hua,

50
00:02:52,599 --> 00:02:54,639
what if I fake my death and run away?

51
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,719
Alright.

52
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,520
Don't be silly.

53
00:02:56,840 --> 00:02:58,319
It's just vocab and practice tests.

54
00:02:59,439 --> 00:03:01,680
How about I talk to your dad for you?

55
00:03:04,439 --> 00:03:05,400
My dear friend.

56
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:06,879
I'm counting on you.

57
00:03:08,919 --> 00:03:09,560
Okay, it's fine.

58
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,439
(Mr. Xie, are you there?)

59
00:03:26,620 --> 00:03:29,020
(Mrs. Xie:)
(Mr. Xie, are you there?)

60
00:03:31,159 --> 00:03:32,520
(Yes. What's up?)

61
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:38,039
(Mr. Xie:)
(What's up?)

62
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:40,319
(Are you free tonight?)

63
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,599
(I'd like to treat you to dinner.)

64
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:46,640
(Are you free tonight?
I'd like to treat you to dinner.)

65
00:03:48,800 --> 00:03:50,439
(Yes, I'm free.)

66
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:52,920
(Yes, I'm free.)

67
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,719
(You pick the place.)

68
00:03:57,120 --> 00:03:58,360
(We can eat whatever you like.)

69
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:02,000
(You pick the place.
We can eat whatever you like.)

70
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,840
(How about your place?)

71
00:04:12,599 --> 00:04:14,039
(I haven't seen your new home yet.)

72
00:04:16,519 --> 00:04:17,879
(He wants dinner at my place?)

73
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,480
(And what about after dinner?)

74
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:21,959
(Will he...?)

75
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:24,319
(See you after work.)

76
00:04:28,879 --> 00:04:30,240
My place?

77
00:04:44,959 --> 00:04:46,399
(I'm no master chef,)

78
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:48,079
(but I can cook a decent meal.)

79
00:04:48,759 --> 00:04:50,079
(It's my first time inviting
him to dinner.)

80
00:04:50,639 --> 00:04:52,120
(I have to make it special.)

81
00:04:52,740 --> 00:04:53,933
♪Feeding on loneliness♪

82
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,213
♪A raspy hum of old love songs♪

83
00:04:56,720 --> 00:04:58,300
♪My wounds have turned to scars♪

84
00:05:04,319 --> 00:05:04,800
Mrs. Xie.

85
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,199
Long time no see.

86
00:05:12,426 --> 00:05:13,900
♪The subway crosses seven time zones♪

87
00:05:14,026 --> 00:05:15,413
♪Rushing to the stop where you are♪

88
00:05:17,013 --> 00:05:18,440
♪The hourglass reverses every regret♪

89
00:05:18,813 --> 00:05:21,213
♪They drift away like powdered sugar♪

90
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,280
♪Fingertips brush trembling chords♪

91
00:05:23,520 --> 00:05:26,040
♪Waking the sleeping piano keys♪
(Signature page, Xie Zhouhan)

92
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:28,213
♪It turns out longing has a shape♪

93
00:05:28,420 --> 00:05:30,466
♪The curve of your face in profile♪

94
00:05:31,106 --> 00:05:32,933
♪Our breathing quickens together♪

95
00:05:33,213 --> 00:05:35,290
♪Melting every winter away♪

96
00:05:35,500 --> 00:05:37,493
♪Old wounds sprout wings♪

97
00:05:37,880 --> 00:05:39,493
♪Diving into clear blue skies♪

98
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:41,893
♪Life is no longer a solo dance♪

99
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:44,293
♪I feel your warmth as we spin♪

100
00:05:44,760 --> 00:05:46,413
♪The brightest star in the galaxy♪

101
00:05:46,700 --> 00:05:49,106
♪Has made its home in my palm♪

102
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:51,293
♪Each new day is like a remix♪

103
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:54,293
♪Adding new layers of sweetness♪

104
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,106
♪I bottle up my loneliness♪

105
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,800
♪And sink it deep into time♪

106
00:06:09,280 --> 00:06:11,226
♪The sunsets I watched alone♪

107
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:13,680
♪Finally see the silhouette
of the two of us♪

108
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:15,813
♪Every corner where I once got lost♪

109
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:19,693
♪Now echoes with the sound of you♪

110
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:22,026
♪Life moves to an electronic beat♪

111
00:06:22,380 --> 00:06:24,480
♪Our vows play on repeat♪

112
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,280
♪The galaxy's most romantic frequency♪

113
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:29,200
♪Is the moment you say you love me♪

114
00:06:29,620 --> 00:06:31,813
♪Loneliness is now in the past♪

115
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:34,213
♪The future is playing out now♪

116
00:06:34,420 --> 00:06:36,160
♪Starlight writes an endless love vow♪

117
00:06:36,440 --> 00:06:38,980
♪Our story goes on across the universe♪
